{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"一瞬鼻に指突っ込んでるんじゃないかと思うけど違う。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや♡2013.4.23"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなからいじられるまあや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズムでは\n私たちカップルなんだよねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはダンスが上手だから\n一緒に踊っててすごい楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生になったら\nぐんと綺麗になるんだろうな(遠い目"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\n学校、稽古と...頑張ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、本当体力ないな。\nもういやーこんな自分いやよー\nバレエ習ってたときの\nからだに戻さないとー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きろー起きろー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちは元気いっぱい\nやる気じゅうぶんだがな！！！\nははははははははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねーねちゃーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねがヒールのある靴履くから\n身長がわからなくなってきた笑\nでも稽古のときはいつもの身長で\n安心するよおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまってるものは\nコンビニの里芋煮とひじきです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"}